    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13325" root="دهو and دهى" body-key="d">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">داهاهُ</span></b>  (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَاهَاةٌ</span>, M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارب</span>, and
K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورب</span>, &amp;c.,) <i>He strove,</i> or <i>endeavoured,
to outwit, deceive, delude, beguile,</i> or <i>circumvent,
him;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرَبَهُ</span>, (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارب</span>,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَارَبَهُ</span>, (K in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورب</span>,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاكَرَهُ</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نكر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">داهى بِدَاهِيَةٍ</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>He smote</i> people
<i>with a calamity.</i> (TA.)

